Scenario: View KB Article as Guest
	@ help.center.acceptance = "true"
	Guests should be able to view all kb article content available to guest users.

	Given I go to the zendesk page URL "/hc/en-us/articles/360016144231"
	And I accept all cookies
	Then I should be able to view the KB article title "Elasticsearch 6 and X-Pack Common Problems"
	And I should be able to view the KB article "resolution" section header
	And I should not be able to view the KB article "resolution" section content
	And I should not be able to view the KB article vote controls
	And the KB article "resolution" section should be gated
	And I should be able to view the KB article sign in message with sign in button

